Third-party software that penrose downloads when it sets up its phone
----------------------------------------------------------------------

These are not part of this repository or of penrose's installers. penrose
downloads them from their publishers on the user's computer:

  The Android SDK tools, emulator and system image, from Google, under the
  Android Software Development Kit License Agreement, which the user accepts
  during setup.
  Magisk (https://github.com/topjohnwu/Magisk), GPL-3.0.
  Vector / LSPosed, GPL-3.0.
  rootAVD, GPL-3.0.
  Eclipse Temurin (OpenJDK), GPL-2.0 with the Classpath Exception.
  apkeep (https://github.com/EFForg/apkeep), MIT, bundled in the installers.

The installers also include the open-source packages listed in
backend/requirements.txt and in the package-lock.json files, under their own
licenses.
